# An ability a static ability grants is that static ability's text (CR 612.3): a text change on the object that has it
# changes the object's own text (CR 612.1), not the granted ability. Artificial Evolution replaces Borg with Elf in Memnite's
# text; the ability Antagonist Incorporator gives it still says Borg, so the token it makes is a Borg.

